{"4257480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LADR", "steam_appid": 4257480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pure team fighting experience in a futuristic world where all conflicts are resolved in the virtual arena - LADR. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked Ladder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tab Targeting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hybrid Classes - A combination of damage, utility and healing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump straight into 5v5 PvP combat. No grind, no requirements, just gaming. The gameplay blends traditional MMO gameplay and action combat to give you a comprehensive PvP experience. Launch into a world where your skills decide your fate. Will you be stuck at the bottom  or will you climb to the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Story</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s 2075, and humanity is too powerful for war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single conflict could devastate the planet, so the world has found a new way to settle disputes: <strong>The Arena</strong>. From petty neighbourhood feuds to international crises, every disagreement is decided by elite competitors who fight their way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this new world, money means nothing. Status means nothing. Titles mean nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your skill is your voice — and your voice is the only power that matters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pure team fighting experience in a futuristic world where all conflicts are resolved in the virtual arena - LADR. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked Ladder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tab Targeting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hybrid Classes - A combination of damage, utility and healing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump straight into 5v5 PvP combat. No grind, no requirements, just gaming. The gameplay blends traditional MMO gameplay and action combat to give you a comprehensive PvP experience. Launch into a world where your skills decide your fate. Will you be stuck at the bottom  or will you climb to the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Story</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s 2075, and humanity is too powerful for war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single conflict could devastate the planet, so the world has found a new way to settle disputes: <strong>The Arena</strong>. From petty neighbourhood feuds to international crises, every disagreement is decided by elite competitors who fight their way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this new world, money means nothing. Status means nothing. Titles mean nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your skill is your voice — and your voice is the only power that matters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "LADR is a fresh take on the traditional tab-targeting PvP experience.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257480/d46d508ee409481ab849099557b2ed0216599993/header.jpg?t=1784360498", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257480/2601493cf08a099636ae68ab469f06ee72b09970/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784360498", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4257480/2601493cf08a099636ae68ab469f06ee72b09970/capsule_184x69.jpg?t